prima-ratio bundles no third-party source code of its own: the container is
built from upstream projects and a public model checkpoint.

Engine
- llama.cpp — https://github.com/ggml-org/llama.cpp — MIT License.
  Pinned commit: see LLAMA_CPP_COMMIT in the Dockerfile. llama.cpp added the
  Decision 3.0 (vllm-sr d3) model family support in ggml-org/llama.cpp #30383.

Model
- Decision 3.0 mini (d3-mini) — https://huggingface.co/vllm-sr/d3-mini — Apache-2.0.
  A 4.54B multimodal decision model from vLLM Semantic Router, built on
  Qwen/Qwen3.5-4B with an answer-code readout.
- GGUF conversion — https://huggingface.co/ggml-org/vllm-d3-mini-GGUF — Apache-2.0.
  Downloaded on first start at the revision pinned in the Dockerfile.

The prima-ratio packaging (Dockerfile, entrypoint, docs) is released under the
license in LICENSE.
